'''Crazed Tank Cat''' (狂乱のタンクネコ, ''Kyōran no Tanku Neko'', '''Frenzy Tank Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that first appears in [[Absolute Defense (Insane)|Absolute Defence]], where she can be unlocked as a [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Unit]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

