==Enemy==
Crazed Tank Cat is very sturdy, having one of the highest health values in the game at 100% strength magnification and only one knockback.

Crazed Tank attacks quite differently from the [[Crazed Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Cat]]: instead of cranking out rapid, close-quarters DPS, she will occasionally bash her head, dealing heavy damage in a shockingly large area. To compensate an attack of this caliber, Crazed Tank moves extremely slowly (note that she often advances a little due to her short backswing). Her other notable quality is [[Base Destroyer]], which will allow her to obliterate the [[Cat Base]] in seconds.

